{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:dcfc9dca93f53bae","name":"Passenger Conversion","source":{"id":"source:reference-dcfc9dca93f53bae","title":"Passenger Conversion","revision":24993,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:53:13Z","sha256":"9942e4680f0b45762cb88de2a690f6bd41f571bdea8441444e4d7baa4827282e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24993","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Passenger%20Conversion&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-dcfc9dca93f53bae","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["PASSENGER CONVERSION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EP\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE RESTRICTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Seating\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["200 (Base)\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Quarters\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal or Larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["500 (Base)\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Some ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transports"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transports","referenceId":"reference:082a04e1f80578b3"}," and small ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," specialize in transporting passengers instead of cargo. One Passenger Conversion has sufficient room for a number of passengers equal to the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"},", and these passengers can either have Seating (typically for voyages of only 1 day or less) or Quarters. In either case, these are steerage-quality accommodations (shared rooms, bunk beds, storage lockers, and so on); for higher quality, the ship may also have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luxury Upgrade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luxury_Upgrade","referenceId":"reference:2ca0e56b2423b7e5"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Passenger Conversion says that it creates room for a number of passengers equal to the ship's size modifier.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Wouldn't the size modifier be -10 for ships that big? Or does it refer to some other size modifier (such as the one used for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappling"},")?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," It is an error, so consider this to be errata: Passenger Conversion has sufficient space for a number of passengers equal to the ship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"},", not size modifier.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
